Djayvo offline source-driven remix
Usage: djayvo_remix --input FILE [--consent | --synthetic-fixture] [--output PREFIX] [--style all|hiphop|reggae|experimental|baseline] [--stems] [--seed UINT32] [--sample-rate 8000..192000] [--block-size 1..65536]
